# Full-course preview setup

Follow the [student setup companion](handouts/FULL_COURSE_SETUP_DRAFT.md) for
installation, validation, kernel selection, shutdown/reopening, and
troubleshooting. The matching [student review-draft PDF](handouts/PHYS3810_Full_Course_Student_Setup_v0.1_REVIEW_DRAFT.pdf)
is included unchanged. Keep the complete course folder together.

This entry point preserves the preflight notebook's setup link without
duplicating the guide. [The package overview](../../README.md) identifies the
exact source and local-preview status. The future public student download is
unpublished; the existing Grover-only download is a different edition.
